# Sepet Kod Denetimi

Bu denetim "'`sepet/` altindaki kod ve sema dosyalarini okuyarak hazirlandi. Derleme cikti dosyalari (`dist/`, tsbuildinfo), SQLite veri dosyasi ve bagimlilik kilidinin tüm satirlari kaynak kod kapsaminda davranissal olarak degerlendirildi; kilit dosyasi paket/versiyon bagimliligi icin okundu. Kaynak dosya degistirilmedi; bu rapor tek olusturulan dosyadir.

## 1. Module Map

| Modul | Sorumluluk | Okudugu tablolar | Yazdigi tablolar |
|---|---|---|---|
| `sepet/api/main.py` | FastAPI uygulamasini kurar; restoran listesi/detayi, mutfak listesi, acik siparis detayi ve siparis olusturma uclarini barindirir. Router kaydi 7-17 satirlarinda; urun/siparis modelleri 20-30 satirlarinda; HTTP uclar 33, 73, 82, 119 ve 142 satirlarinda baslar. | `restaurant`, `restaurant_review`, `menu_item`, `"order"`, `order_item`; auth bagimliligindan dolayi `auth_token` + `"user"` | `"user"` bakiyesi, `"order"`, `order_item` |
| `sepet/api/accounts.py` | Kayit, giris, oturum bilgisi ve cuzdan yukleme akislarini yonetir. Route tanimlari 59, 89, 101 ve 110 satirlarinda. | `"user"`, `auth_token`; `get_current_user` uzerinden `auth_token` + `"user"` | `"user"`, `auth_token`; restoran rolunde kayitta `restaurant` |
| `sepet/api/auth.py` | Bearer token cözümler, zorunlu/opsiyonel kimlik ve rol/profil dogrulamasi yapar. Token JOIN 10-15 satirlarinda, rol korumalari 23-60 satirlarinda. | `auth_token`, `"user"`, `restaurant`, `courier` | Yok |
| `sepet/api/db.py` | SQLite baglantisi, UTC zaman ve PBKDF2 sifre hash/dogrulama yardimcilarini saglar. Baglanti 11-14, hash yardimcilari 21-33 satirlarinda. | Yok | Yok |
| `sepet/api/panels.py` | Musteri gecmisi, restoran siparis/menu/kurye yonetimi, kurye islemleri, teslim onayi ve kazanc raporunu yonetir. Route'"'lar 68, 84, 106, 117, 128, 148, 160, 190, 207, 226 ve 247 satirlarinda. | "'`"order"`, `order_item`, `restaurant`, `"user"`, `courier`, `menu_item`; auth korumalari uzerinden `auth_token`, `restaurant` ve `courier` | `"order"`, `order_item` olusturulmuyor ama okunuyor; `"order"` guncelleniyor, `courier`, `menu_item`, `"user"` yaziliyor |
| `sepet/api/reviews.py` | Onaylanmis siparis sartiyla restoran yorumu olusturur ve puan hesaplamasini saglar. Puan fonksiyonu 13-15, route 18-50 satirlarinda. | `restaurant`, `"order"`, `restaurant_review`, `"user"` | `restaurant_review` |
| `sepet/api/seed.py` | `sepet.db` dosyasini siler, `schema.sql` calistirir ve demo restoran/menu/hesap verisini kurar. Resetleme 162-166, demo sifre 193 satirinda. | `schema.sql` uzerinden semayi kurar; id eslemek icin `restaurant` okur | `restaurant`, `menu_item`, `"user"`, `courier`; dolayli olarak tüm sema |

## 2. Coupling

| Bagimli modul | Bagli modul | Dosya:satir ve nokta |
|---|---|---|
| `main.py` | `accounts.py` | Import: `main.py:7`; router kaydi: `main.py:15`. |
| `main.py` | `auth.py` | Import: `main.py:8`; `get_optional_user` kullanimi: `main.py:83`; `require_customer` kullanimi: `main.py:143`. |
| `main.py` | `db.py` | Import: `main.py:9`; `get_db` cagrilar: `main.py:47`, `75`, `84`, `121`, `149`. |
| `main.py` | `panels.py` | Import: `main.py:10`; router kaydi: `main.py:16`. |
| `main.py` | `reviews.py` | Import: `main.py:11`; router kaydi: `main.py:17`; `displayed_rating` cagrilar: `main.py:59` ve `103`. |
| `accounts.py` | `auth.py` | Import: `accounts.py:7`; `get_current_user` kullanimi: `accounts.py:102` ve `111`. |
| `accounts.py` | `db.py` | Import: `accounts.py:8`; `get_db`: `accounts.py:62`, `91`, `115`; `issue_token` icerisinde `utc_now`: `accounts.py:54`; `hash_password`: `accounts.py:67`; `verify_password`: `accounts.py:95`. |
| `auth.py` | `db.py` | Import: `auth.py:3`; `get_db`: `auth.py:19`, `42`, `54`. |
| `panels.py` | `auth.py` | Import: `panels.py:6`; `require_restaurant`: `panels.py:87`, `107`, `118`, `129`, `149`, `164`, `248`; `require_courier`: `panels.py:191`; `require_customer`: `panels.py:227`. |
| `panels.py` | `db.py` | Import: `panels.py:7`; `get_db`: `panels.py:70`, `101`, `109`, `120`, `133`, `151`, `168`, `193`, `211`, `229`, `250`; `hash_password`: `panels.py:138`; `utc_now`: `panels.py:167`, `210`, `228`. |
| `reviews.py` | `auth.py` | Import: `reviews.py:5`; aktif kullanim `require_customer`: `reviews.py:22`. |
| `reviews.py` | `db.py` | Import: `reviews.py:6`; `get_db`: `reviews.py:26`; `utc_now`: `reviews.py:48`. |
| `reviews.py` | `panels.py` | `ReviewInput` importu: `reviews.py:7`; payload kullanimi: `reviews.py:21`, `31-32`, `48`. |
| `seed.py` | `db.py` | Import: `seed.py:4`; `hash_password`: `seed.py:193`; `utc_now`: `seed.py:194`. |

Ek baglantilar: tum HTTP modulleri `get_db()` uzerinden SQLite'"'a baglanir. "'`auth.py` yalniz bir alt katman oldugu icin onun urettigi `user` ve `restaurant`/`courier` tuple'"'lari hem "'`main.py` hem `panels.py`/`reviews.py` tarafindan kullanilir. `reviews.py` in `ReviewInput` modelini `panels.py`den almasi, yorum dogrulamasini panel modulune kavusturur; domain modelleri ayri bir schema/modulde daha az cift yonlu olurdu.

## 3. Request Lifecycle

| Endpoint | Uc-ucu iz |
|---|---|
| `GET /api/restaurants` | `list_restaurants` (`main.py:33`) -> parametre filtreleri (`main.py:37-46`) -> `get_db` (`main.py:47`) -> `restaurant` select (`main.py:48`) ve `restaurant_review` ortalamasi (`main.py:49-54`) -> `displayed_rating` (`reviews.py:13`; cagri `main.py:59-60`) -> Python tarafi filtre/siralama (`main.py:63-70`). |
| `GET /api/cuisines` | `list_cuisines` (`main.py:73`) -> `get_db` (`main.py:75`) -> `restaurant.cuisine` select (`main.py:76-78`) -> string listesi (`main.py:79`). |
| `GET /api/restaurants/{restaurant_id}` | `get_restaurant` (`main.py:82`) -> `get_optional_user` (`auth.py:29`) -> `resolve_user` (`auth.py:18`) -> `_user_from_token` (`auth.py:6`) ve `auth_token JOIN user` (`auth.py:10-15`) -> `get_db` (`main.py:84`) -> `restaurant`, `menu_item`, `restaurant_review JOIN user` selectleri (`main.py:85-99`) -> `displayed_rating` (`main.py:103`; tanim `reviews.py:13`) -> musteri ise `"order"` ve `restaurant_review` kontrolu (`main.py:106-115`) -> restoran + menu + yorum payload. |
| `GET /api/orders/{order_id}` | `get_order` (`main.py:119`) -> kimlik/ownership dependency yok -> `get_db` (`main.py:121`) -> `"order" JOIN restaurant` select (`main.py:122-128`) -> `order_item` select (`main.py:131-136`) -> tüm siparis detayi doner (`main.py:137-139`). |
| `POST /api/orders` | `create_order` (`main.py:142`) -> `require_customer` (`auth.py:33`) -> `get_current_user` (`auth.py:23`) -> `resolve_user` (`auth.py:18`) -> `_user_from_token` (`auth.py:6`) -> bos sepet kontrolu (`main.py:144`) -> `get_db` (`main.py:149`) -> `restaurant` select (`main.py:150`) -> `menu_item` select (`main.py:156-161`) -> minimum sepet (`main.py:166-172`) ve bakiye kontrolu (`main.py:174-180`) -> `user.balance` UPDATE (`main.py:181-184`) -> `"order"` INSERT (`main.py:189-203`) -> `order_item` INSERT dongusu (`main.py:205-212`) -> id/status/total doner (`main.py:214`). |
| `POST /api/auth/register` | `register` (`accounts.py:59`) -> `validate_registration` (`accounts.py:40`; cagri `61`) -> `get_db` (`accounts.py:62`) -> e-posta unique kontrolu (`accounts.py:63`) -> `user` INSERT ve 100 TL bakiye (`accounts.py:65-68`) -> restoran rolunde `restaurant` INSERT (`accounts.py:70-84`) -> `issue_token` ile `auth_token` INSERT (`accounts.py:50-56`; cagri `85`) -> token/user doner (`accounts.py:86`). |
| `POST /api/auth/login` | `login` (`accounts.py:89`) -> `get_db` (`accounts.py:91`) -> `user` select (`accounts.py:92-94`) -> `verify_password` (`db.py:27`; cagri `accounts.py:95`) -> `issue_token` (`accounts.py:97`; tanim `accounts.py:50`) -> token/user doner (`accounts.py:98`). |
